            "items": [
              "Error metrics: how much predictions differ from actual values. If a grocery model predicts 8,000 rupees and the actual bill is 10,000, the difference is the error.",
              "Accuracy metrics: how many predictions were correct. For a pass/fail model, accuracy is how often it was right."
            ]
          }
        ]
